# Static page JS

- Depend on `MithraDraft` / `StoreAPI` / `MithraAssets` — load order: assets-config → store-draft → store-api → page script
- Persist via `MithraDraft.saveDraft` / `StoreAPI.saveRelease`; don’t invent new localStorage keys unless extending `StoreAPI.KEYS`
- Theme: `MithraDraft.applyTheme(hex)` after loading draft/release
- Share helpers: `qrImageUrl`, `downloadQrImage`, `absoluteUrl`, `whatsappLink` on `MithraDraft`
- Vendor auth: `StoreAPI.setVendorSession` / `logoutVendor` (roles `vendor` | `admin`)
- Keep vanilla ES5-compatible IIFEs in `assets/js` (no bundler on these pages)
- Prefer progressive enhancement: UI works without remote QR CDN (placeholder + open link fallback)
